// S3 -- "The far larder", `Reports/lab-behaviour-scenarios-2026-09-06.md`.
// A colony at one wall and a single heap at the other, so a route between
// them has somewhere to form -- `selective-environments-2026-09-05.md` §4
// already measured a far larder against a scattered one at 3 of 4 seeds,
// median 37.8% for the trail-less arm. One open compartment (no walls to
// isolate the route from itself) and shallow digging is not a confound
// here: nothing in this bed asks an ant to tunnel.
//
// **The caveat is the report's own**: the trail pathway is worth most of the
// move decision at ~60% laden and under 1% empty or full, and a far larder
// sends ants out empty and home full -- exactly where it is worth least. A
// null here would be a finding about the carry-band gate, not a failed
// scenario. See `scattered_larder.ron` for the paired control.
//
// **The colony sits at x: 107, not the wall.** `labshot scenario=far_larder`
// found only 35 of 52 ants placeable at x: 40 -- `creature::colony_stations`
// centres a 52-ant band on the cursor, and at spacing 4 that band runs 204
// cells wide, so a cursor at 40 puts its left third off the west edge of the
// world where no site exists. x: 107 is the smallest column (of
// 64/80/96/102/104-107 tried against a rebuilt `labshot`) at which the
// whole band lands in bounds and all 52 place; 106 still loses one. The heap
// stays at x: 470, 363 cells clear of the band's right edge.
//
// **Food per 6,000-frame window against the colony's idle burn**: an ant
// idles at 0.10 energy/tick, so 52 ants burn 52 * 0.10 * 6000 = 31,200 over
// a window. The heap is 60 cells at build (57,600, covering the first
// window and the founding cost) and repeats at 30 cells every 6,000 frames
// after that (28,800, 92.3% of the burn) -- the same ratio `two_larders.ron`
// documents, already over half and left alone.
(
    name: "far_larder",
    title: "FAR LARDER",
    question: "A colony at one wall, one heap at the other -- does a route form on the pheromone overlay that the scattered control never draws?",
    bed: (
        width: 512,
        height: 320,
        soil_depth: 96,
        ground_y: 160,
        compartments: 1,
        founders: 0,
        species: "herb",
        colonies: 0,
        colony_ants: 52,
        colony_species: "ant",
        predators: 0,
        lamp_spacing: 33,
        seed: 1,
        extra_walls: [],
    ),
    settings: [],
    placements: [
        Colony(species: "ant", x: 107, count: 52),
        Heap(material: "windfall", x: 470, cells: 60),
    ],
    timeline: [
        (at: 6000, every: 6000, until: 0, what: Heap(material: "windfall", x: 470, cells: 30)),
    ],
    horizon: 24000,
)
